      {
        "block": "paragraph",
        "text": "The Half of It is a 2020 coming-of-age comedy-drama film about a shy, smart Chinese-American teen named Ellie Chu helps a sweet, inarticulate jock named Paul Munsky write love letters to Aster Flores. Ellie secretly falls in love with Aster too, leading to an unexpected friendship and a journey of self-discovery.",
        "wikitext": "'''''[[w:The Half of It|The Half of It]]''''' is a [[w:2020 in film|2020]] coming-of-age comedy-drama film about a shy, smart Chinese-American teen named Ellie Chu helps a sweet, inarticulate jock named Paul Munsky write love letters to Aster Flores. Ellie secretly falls in love with Aster too, leading to an unexpected friendship and a journey of self-discovery.",
